Z||000004||Oreif||06-20-2001||03:08 AM||||It's an "All GM" show. It's from 9am until 3pm. Registration is 9am until noon. Haze won a trophy at it last year! They usually have 2 classes, Modified and Stock. Last year was only one class due to the small number that showed up. (5 cars were there and it rained that morning)<BR>Leadfoot, If you want to go just to check it out you can ride along with me.<P>I'll also be bringing a few sets of emblems for those interested.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||1
