Z||000007||Oreif||06-20-2001||07:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Bazooka:<BR><B>Oreif,<BR>   I'm still in the planning and 'clear the way stage' of things. Are you near Roselle and Irving? What is the date for the Naperville show?<BR>***************************************<BR> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I am closer to Irving and Wise. (About a 1/2 mile away from Menard's) The show is Sunday 24 June 2001 (4 days from now) It is at Village Pontiac 1585 W Ogden Ave<BR>In Naperville.<P><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||1
